  "label": "Illegal Immigration Politics",
  "description": "The phrase 'stop illegal immigrants' refers to a real-world political and social debate in countries like the United States, where immigration policy, border control, and the status of undocumented immigrants are contentious issues. The meme uses this political framing to justify the goat's accusation, even though the animals are not real immigrants. The concept of 'taking land' is a common trope in anti-immigrant rhetoric, often used to frame immigration as a threat to national identity and property.",
